# bad_conic.part -- A cone cut by a plane at a slant
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The round corner of the outline leans, a cone, and the cutting box
# crosses it with a plane along its axis: the two meet in a hyperbola.

profile p along z 0 0 4 20 0 0 20 20 0 0 20 0
extrude blk from 0 to 10 p draft 5
profile q along z -1 -1 0 2 -1 0 2 30 0 -1 30 0
extrude box from 2 to 8 q
cut u blk box
